{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_08",
  "title": "罗德岛大食堂",
  "storyCode": "DT-8",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "87c128760b75111742be669ea61d5db92ff2e44efcbde47a2ccecd2882f06e24",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "汇总一下我们一路上收集的有关罗德岛的情报吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "首先，大鲍勃和大祭司都认为罗德岛可以帮助我们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "其次，小刻也说这里有个叫作“博士”的人肯定知道怎么解决我们的问题......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "以及，我们这次好像终于真的接近那艘舰船了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "希望那里真的有能解决我们问题的方法......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "你们快过来看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在齐尔查克的招呼下，三人走到了悬崖边，那一瞬间，他们就理解了齐尔查克的语气为什么会有些焦急。\n那是一艘过于巨大的陆上舰船。\n在陆地上航行，却比他们见过的任何一艘水上船只都要庞大。\n一座钢铁巨构。一座城市。一座......迷宫。\n这就是——“罗德岛”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "......真的是一艘在陆地行驶的舰船啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "我们真的能在那里找到回去的路吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "首先，我觉得我们应该考虑的是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "我们该怎么进去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "从这里我甚至看不见它的入口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "......你们看！那边好像有一支队伍在靠近罗德岛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "看起来好像是一支商队。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "商队......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "各位，我们去和他们聊聊吧？看他们是否愿意带我们进去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先锋干员",
      "text": "我们回来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "辛苦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先锋干员",
      "text": "没事。对了，我们刚刚还遇到了四个来求助的人，穿着打扮都挺奇怪的，说是和刻俄柏认识，想让罗德岛帮他们回家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "嗯？回家？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先锋干员",
      "text": "大概是这个意思，总之辛苦你给他们带一下路，我去和外勤部对接了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯小队",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "你好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "如果你们是专门来罗德岛求助的，应该是要找博士或者是阿米娅吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "嗯......小刻倒是说过“博士”，我们可能是要找这个人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "你能带我们去见这个博士吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......我还需要确认下你们的身份，你们先跟我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "哦哦......！不好意思，我的东西掉了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "《鲍勃的美食指南》？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "你们认识大鲍勃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "嗯，我们来这里吃到的第一顿饭就是他做的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "能把那样坚硬的虫子处理成一道道美味的食物，老夫很敬佩那个人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "我明白了......原来他说的“那些朋友”就是你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "......什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "我叫泥岩，大鲍勃和我讲过你们。当初他们刚决定不再当佣兵，想要换一个活法，但完全不知道开农场的事能不能行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "荒野上的农场经常会遭到洗劫，大鲍勃也不认识几个做生意的人，啤酒做出来也不知道好不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "但你们当时吃他的料理的样子很幸福，给了他不少信心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "老夫当时并没有看出来他这样窘迫......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "那......那他现在怎么样......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "不知道，我们也很久没见过了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "我只是听说他后来源石虫啤酒厂办得很好，赚了不少钱，也过上好日子了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "那就好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "但后来又听说好像是挣钱的时候得罪了当地政府，说是税务还是什么问题，被关进监狱里了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "......啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "监狱？那他们现在还好吗......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "前段时间又听说他们好像越狱还是保释出来了，人没什么问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "......嗯？嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "越狱啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "再听说到的就是他们好像在萨米开了家杂货店，生意不错呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "真是......很有毅力地在生活啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "不管怎么说，先跟我来吧，我们坐电梯上去......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "电梯......？就是这个铁盒子吗......？它怎么用？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "看起来也像是一个魔法器具......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "你们先进，我们去一层，稍等，我拿个......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "嗯......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "text": "......人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯小队",
      "text": "怎么一开门全都变了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "这是哪里？刚刚发生了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "怎么这里看起来更像是个迷宫啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾尔启",
      "text": "......果然是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "你是萨米的独眼巨人......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "独眼巨人？！为什么齐尔查克你会——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "等等，你出现在这里，该不会是因为你又看到了什么吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾尔启",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "你看到了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾尔启",
      "text": "在你们前进的道路上，有着火光、冲击......以及凶恶的兽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "......你知道刻俄柏或者博士在哪里吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾尔启",
      "text": "刻俄柏刚刚回到罗德岛，现在应该在训练室，在那个方位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾尔启",
      "text": "博士......请原谅我暂时不能告诉你什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "......谢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "那我们......要先过去吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "泥岩好像已经彻底和我们走散了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "这里就是那位女士说的训练室了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "这里好像没什么人......那边倒是有一个好大的怪东西......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "你们还愣着干什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "欸，大祭司？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "大祭司，你有见到刻俄柏吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "她刚才还在这里，不过已经跑走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "你们想见到那个小家伙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "那就别磨蹭了，赶紧都过来，坐进这台机器里！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "欸？啊......好、好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "text": "大祭司，我们得到消息，好像有走失的访客往这边来了，你有见到吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "什么？我没见过，我们正在这边做新型号大丑的抗冲击安全测试。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "建议你们离远一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "text": "呃......好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "搞定，祖玛玛，准备就绪！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你确定？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "当然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驾驶舱内的莱欧斯小队",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "text": "我怎么好像看到里面有人被炸飞了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "你确定你看到有人被炸飞了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "text": "咦......消失了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "text": "难道我真的看错了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "行了，去别的地方找吧，你要找的人不在这。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "text": "好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你这完全是公报私仇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "他们炖了我一次，我炸他们一次，也算是礼尚往来吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你把他们弄哪里去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "他们想要找刻俄柏，我就送他们去找刻俄柏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "这可没有骗他们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "从爆炸中回过神来，四人发现自己不知何时飘在了有些眼熟的半空之中，并且开始往下坠。\n正下方，竟然是熟悉的婆山镇，而黎正用古怪的眼神看着他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯小队",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊啊，救命——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "四人在空中张牙舞爪却束手无策。\n不过，他们马上发现，自己的正下方，并不是地面，而是一口深不见底的井。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他们并没有与地面亲密接触，而是直接摔入了井中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "......虽然方法有些粗暴，不过，她这也算是送各位一程了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "有缘再会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "小刻又跑到厨房来了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "不过，这次她的样子好像有点奇怪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "奇怪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "嗯——这次她回来之后变得有些沉默。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "我去和她聊聊天吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "小刻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "你怎么了，是身体不舒服吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "唔......我也说不上来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "回到本舰后，就觉得身体怪怪的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "既然这样，我们去做一次全面检查好不好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "......不要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "我说不上来，但是，我觉得我应该一个人待一会儿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "唔......那你先去休息一下吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "咦？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "嘶——我的屁股......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "这里是......厨房？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狙击干员",
      "text": "什么人？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "阿米娅，站在我身后！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "各位，小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "看来，大祭司把我们送到了不太好的地方......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "大祭司？你们到底——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "是小刻去休息的房间！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "我们快去看看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "发生了什么......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "他们提到了小刻，我们也快跟去看一看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "这......这是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "小刻，是你吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏？",
      "text": "肚子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "这......这到底是怎么回事？这是我们认识的小刻吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏？",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "我能从她的情绪感觉到，她依然是我们认识的小刻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "她在克制，但是，她快要忍不住了......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "这......这是我们认识的小刻吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏？",
      "text": "（嘶吼）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "......好帅！小刻，你原来还有这种本领！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "现在是说这些的时候吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "我们得想办法救救小刻！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "几位客人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "按你们刚才说的话，我可以理解为你们是关心小刻的状况而来到这里的，对吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "虽然我们来这里是为了能找到回到我们那个世界的方法......但是我们也很担心小刻！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "那么，眼下先让我们放下一些疑问，一起压制住小刻吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "不然的话，事情会变得一发不可收拾的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "莱欧斯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "嗯，暂时联手吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
